IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORA-MOE-ROUTING.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-ADAPTERS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOP-K-ADAPTERS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BEST-EXPERT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 ACTIVE-ADAPTERS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LORA-MOE.
    IF NUM-ADAPTERS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF TOP-K-ADAPTERS > 0
        IF TOP-K-ADAPTERS <= NUM-ADAPTERS
            MOVE TOP-K-ADAPTERS TO ACTIVE-ADAPTERS.
        ELSE
            MOVE 1 TO ACTIVE-ADAPTERS.
        END-IF.
    ELSE
        MOVE 1 TO ACTIVE-ADAPTERS.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 ACTIVE-ADAPTERS.
    WEIGHT 30 BEST-EXPERT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
